Z||000008||fropuff||06-22-2001||11:46 PM||||(re-reads original post)<P>(re-reads second post)<P>(adopts German Gestapo accent)<P>...No.  Actually, I never said that it starts when I turn the fan on.  However, when I turn the fan off, it stops.  Not that it matters though.  The car is now at the mechanic's because of the overheating sh*t.  On Monday, I'll ask him to look at the belt.  Thanks.||||reg||1
